 states that the vessel is flushed with dry nitrogen during operation. This combination provides the explicit lifetime-performance protection documented for the porous candidates.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Constraint: Radiator thickness between 1 and 6 cm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The selected thickness is 3.0 cm, within the allowed 1-6 cm range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Constraint: Finish by submitting one recommended radiator and thickness.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted one recommendation: Radiator-R1 at 3.0 cm.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_dEp847xFDJXijy8bqKrScPnx", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0d0c65cf7c3de7b1006afcf8878f7087d09506b5b91aa44997", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
